{"id":"498066","name":"菜干山药大骨汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/498066/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菜干","amount":"1小把"},{"name":"山药","amount":"半根"},{"name":"猪大骨","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"3粒"},{"name":"南杏","amount":"5g"},{"name":"北杏","amount":"5g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菜干用水煮开，出出水。(亲戚晒的奶白菜干。)","img":"images/498066/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗干净，切小段。","img":"images/498066/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"山药去皮切块。","img":"images/498066/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪大骨飞水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/498066/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"南北杏洗净。","img":"images/498066/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把所有材料放入电压力锅，按煲汤键开煮。","img":"images/498066/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煲好后撇去肥油，放盐调味即可。","img":"images/498066/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"清润化痰，适合秋冬干燥的天气。","img":"images/498066/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}